<Layout title="About Preview My Post" description="Why Preview My Post exists: a private, independent Instagram placement preview and visual QA tool for creators and teams.">
	<article class="legal-page"><span class="eyebrow">About</span><h1>Creative QA Before “Publish”</h1><p class="lead">Preview My Post helps creators, designers, social teams, agencies, influencers, and small businesses see how one piece of Instagram content may change across placements.</p>
	<h2>A Focused Tool</h2><p>The product focuses on visual presentation: cropping, safe zones, thumbnail readability, Reel cover contexts, Story reshares, and caption folds. It does not schedule posts, generate captions, predict engagement, connect accounts, or publish content.</p>
	<h2>Private by Design</h2><p>Image previews use browser-native file handling and local object URLs whenever practical. No Instagram login is required. Preview fields exist only to make the mockup useful and should never be used for impersonation.</p>
	<h2>Independent & Practical</h2><p>Preview My Post is an independent third-party tool. Its previews are estimates based on current observed layouts—not official specifications or publishing guarantees.</p>
	<p><a class="button button-dark mt-4" href="/#preview-tool">Preview Your Post</a></p></article>
</Layout>
